{FFFF00}No bug abuse{FFFFFF}: report glitches to an {33CC55}admin{FFFFFF}, don't use them.	{FFFF00}Sin abuso de errores{FFFFFF}: informe los fallos a un {33CC55}administrador{FFFFFF}, no los utilice.
